        "gg-71aRsR4S_text": "<p>Food safety is crucial, yet often overlooked, especially when it comes to Shilajit. We believe that comprehensive testing and greater awareness will push manufacturers to uphold higher standards. Shilajit deserves to be represented accurately, and low-quality imitations or untested products damage its reputation. Always ask questions and request proof of quality—it’s essential to prioritize your health.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>At Wellness Nest, we choose <a href=\"https://www.eurofins.com/\"><span style=\"color:#025AFF;\"><strong><u>Eurofins</u></strong></span></a><strong> </strong>because of their unwavering commitment to accuracy and quality. Their extensive expertise in bio-analytical testing guarantees that every batch of shilajit we offer is meticulously analyzed for purity and safety. From heavy metal screening to microbiological assessments, Eurofins leaves no stone unturned.</p><p><strong>=&gt; Check our lab test result </strong><a href=\"https://wellnessnest.co/pages/lab-test-result\"><span style=\"color:#025AFF;\"><strong><u>HERE</u></strong></span></a></p>",
        "gg3qW2MMqRA_label": "<p>CHECK OUR SHILAJIT COLLECTION&nbsp;</p>",
        "gg6X30OJCMD_text": "Shilajit Essential Extract",
